==History==
2024
*The Suspicious Bush card was added to the game on 30/7/2024, in the [[Version History#Goblin Queen's Journey Changes Update (30/7/2024)|Goblin Queen's Journey Changes Update]].
*On 8/10/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (8/10/2024)|Balance Update]], increased the Suspicious Bush's movement speed to 60 (from 45), now classified as Medium.
*On 30/10/2024, the [[Version History#Removal of Goblin Queen's Journey Update (30/10/2024)|Removal of Goblin Queen's Journey Update]], moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] to unlock the Suspicious Bush from Party Beach to Rascal's Hideout.
2025
*On 9/4/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (9/4/2025)|Balance Update]], increased the Bush Goblins' damage by 12%.

